PURPOSE household_bill_management.
PERMIT agent.billpay TO READ_BALANCE ON account.chequing-001.
PERMIT agent.billpay TO INITIATE_PAYMENT FROM account.chequing-001 TO beneficiary.hydro-quebec WITH MAX_AMOUNT 250 CAD PER TRANSACTION.
LIMIT TOTAL_PAYMENTS TO 500 CAD PER CALENDAR_MONTH.
REQUIRE 2 HUMAN_APPROVALS FOR PAYMENTS ABOVE 100 CAD.
PROHIBIT EXTERNAL_TRANSFER.
PROHIBIT DELEGATION.
EXPIRE AT {{EXPIRES_AT}}.
